{
  "summary": "This experiment tested multimodal fusion using scvi_n200 (RNA) and resnet50 (image) encoders with avgpool aggregation and concat fusion. Validation accuracy of 0.6315 is lower than RNA-only multiprofile baselines (e.g., 0.6501 for scvi_n200 alone), suggesting multimodal integration may not improve performance in this configuration. The limited comparative evidence leaves uncertainty about the effectiveness of this fusion strategy or its potential to benefit from alternative aggregation methods."
}

